        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Wedding Information</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 20px;\">\n\n<div style=\"max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n\n<p>Hi {{ $json.fields['First Name'] }}</p>\n\n<p>I hope you received our wedding package information!</p>\n\n<p>Planning a wedding for you and {{ $json.fields['Partner Full Name'].split(' ')[0] }} can feel overwhelming - there's so much to think about, and I'm sure you're both looking at multiple venues right now.</p>\n\n<p>That's exactly why we have professional wedding planners on our team who can walk you and {{ $json.fields['Partner Full Name'].split(' ')[0] }} through everything in a relaxed chat. Whether it's just the two of you on a video call, or you'd prefer to come out and see the space together - completely up to you.</p>\n\n<p><strong>It's honestly just a conversation.</strong> No pressure, no hard sell. We're here to answer your questions, show you what's possible, and help you both figure out if this is the right fit for your day.</p>\n\n<p>We can also check if your preferred date is still available while we chat.</p>\n\n<div style=\"border: 2px solid #f86293; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; background-color: #fff;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\">Wedding Enquiries</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #666;\">Duration: 30 mins | Timezone: Australia/Perth</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 15px 0;\">\n<a href=\"https://cal.com/team/wise-winery/wedding-enquiries?name={{ $json.fields['First Name'] }}&lastname={{ $json.fields['Last Name'] }}&email={{ $json.fields['Email'] }}&mobile={{ $json.fields['Moblie'] }}&partner={{ $json.fields['Partner Full Name'] }}&eventDate={{ $json.fields['Wedding Date'] }}&people={{ $json.fields['People'] }}&notes={{ $json.fields['Additional Information'] }}&cal.tz=Australia/Perth\" style=\"background-color: #f86293; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\">See all available times</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #999;\">Powered by Wise</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>If you and {{ $json.fields['Partner Full Name'].split(' ')[0] }} would prefer to look around on your own first, that's totally fine - we're here whenever you're ready.</p>\n\n<p>Looking forward to chatting with you both!</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<!-- Signature starts here -->\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"vertical-align: -webkit-baseline-middle; font-size: medium; font-family: Arial;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"vertical-align: -webkit-baseline-middle; font-size: medium; font-family: Arial;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"vertical-align: -webkit-baseline-middle; font-size: medium; font-family: Arial;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTjxDQJRpxq-gJ1lLJUBkdDMCJSm0P6owEsRQ&s\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"130\" style=\"max-width: 128px; display: block;\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"30\" aria-label=\"Horizontal Spacer\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"vertical-align: -webkit-baseline-middle; font-size: medium; font-family: Arial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: center; display: inline-block;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<td>\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wisewines\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(112, 117, 219); border-radius: 50%;\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn2.hubspot.net/hubfs/53/tools/email-signature-generator/icons/facebook-icon-dark-2x.png\" alt=\"facebook\" width=\"24\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background-color: rgb(112, 117, 219); max-width: 135px; display: block; border-radius: inherit;\">\n</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"5\" aria-label=\"Vertical Spacer\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px;\"></div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wiseweddings/?hl=en\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(112, 117, 219); border-radius: 50%;\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn2.hubspot.net/hubfs/53/tools/email-signature-generator/icons/instagram-icon-dark-2x.png\" alt=\"instagram\" width=\"24\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background-color: rgb(112, 117, 219); max-width: 135px; display: block; border-radius: inherit;\">\n</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n<td width=\"46\" aria-label=\"Vertical Spacer\">\n<div style=\"width: 46px;\"></div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px; vertical-align: middle;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 600;\">\n<span>Weddings</span><span> </span><span>Team</span>\n</h2>\n<div style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;\">\n<span>Wise Eagle bay</span>\n</div>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"vertical-align: -webkit-baseline-middle; font-size: medium; font-family: Arial; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"30\" aria-label=\"Horizontal Spacer\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"auto\" aria-label=\"Divider\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(248, 98, 149); border-left: none; display: block;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"30\" aria-label=\"Horizontal Spacer\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"vertical-align: -webkit-baseline-middle; font-size: medium; font-family: Arial;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"vertical-align: middle;